			(property "Description" "High Performance 3-axis Magnetic Sensor  The MMC5983MA is an AEC-Q100 qualified complete 3-axis magnetic sensor with on-chip signal processing and integrated I2C/SPI bus suitable for use in automotive applications. The device can be connected directly to a microprocessor, eliminating the need for A/D converters or timing resources. It can measure magnetic fields within the full scale range of ±8 Gauss (G), with 0.25mG/0.0625mG per LSB resolution at 16bits/18bits operation mode and 0.4 mG total RMS noise level, enabling heading accuracy of ±0.5° in electronic compass applications."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
